<h1>Locus - The Newspaper of the Science Fiction Field</h1>

<i>Locus</i> is precisely what it's title claims it to be:
a monthly publication devoted primarily to reviews and news. 
Their website is at <a href="http://www.Locusmag.com">http://www.Locusmag.com</a>.
A one year subscription is $43.00; write to:
<pre>
    Locus Publications
    PO Box 13305
    Oakland, CA 94661
    Phone: 510-339-9198
    Fax:   510-339-8144    
</pre>
